# Each call of the mixin gets a copy of it, entered where the callee is the mixin: the class extends what one of two calls returns. The instances are arrays, known by their structure.
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: HasStructureOfClass
# CHECK: AreMembersUnchanged {{*}}key="spot"
